    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3418" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκράτ-εια</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρᾰ], ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρατής</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>want of
				power, debility</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεύρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					5.16
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Liqu.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>incontinence, want of self-control</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκράτεια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				461b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				734b
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἡδονῶν τε καὶ
				ἐπιθυμιῶν</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				886a
			</span></i>, etc., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.406
			</span></i>.</div>
